# Additional RustFS settings, one KEY=value per line, read at every start.
# Values set here override the package defaults.
#
# The package already ships safe defaults for a single-HDD NAS
# (RUSTFS_DRIVE_TIMEOUT_PROFILE=high_latency and related timeouts) so that
# RustFS does not answer 503 / SlowDown under sustained backup load. Override
# them here if your hardware differs. See the upstream documentation at
# https://docs.rustfs.com (operations / drive-timeout-tuning).
#
# Examples:
#RUSTFS_SERVER_DOMAINS=s3.example.org
#RUSTFS_REGION=us-east-1
